### BuildX API Testing Guide
### Base URL: http://localhost:5000

### 1. Test Server Health
GET http://localhost:5000/

###

### 2. User Registration
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

###

### 3. User Login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

###

### 4. User Logout
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/logout

###

### 5. Create New Project (requires login)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "My Landing Page",
  "description": "A beautiful landing page for my business",
  "components": [
    {
      "id": "header-1",
      "type": "navbar",
      "properties": {
        "title": "My Business",
        "links": ["Home", "About", "Contact"]
      },
      "styles": {
        "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
        "color": "#333333"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hero-1",
      "type": "text",
      "properties": {
        "content": "Welcome to My Business",
        "fontSize": "48px"
      },
      "styles": {
        "textAlign": "center",
        "color": "#2563eb"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 100
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cta-button-1",
      "type": "button",
      "properties": {
        "text": "Get Started",
        "action": "redirect",
        "url": "/signup"
      },
      "styles": {
        "backgroundColor": "#2563eb",
        "color": "white",
        "padding": "12px 24px",
        "borderRadius": "8px"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 50,
        "y": 200
      }
    }
  ],
  "settings": {
    "theme": "light",
    "layout": "responsive"
  }
}

###

### 6. Get All User Projects (requires login)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/projects

###

### 7. Get Single Project by ID (requires login)
# Replace {project_id} with actual project ID from previous response
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/projects/{project_id}

###

### 8. Update Project (requires login)
# Replace {project_id} with actual project ID
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/v1/projects/{project_id}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Landing Page",
  "description": "Updated description for my landing page",
  "components": [
    {
      "id": "header-1",
      "type": "navbar",
      "properties": {
        "title": "Updated Business Name",
        "links": ["Home", "About", "Services", "Contact"]
      },
      "styles": {
        "backgroundColor": "#1f2937",
        "color": "#ffffff"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    }
  ]
}

###

### 9. Publish/Unpublish Project (requires login)
# Replace {project_id} with actual project ID
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/v1/projects/{project_id}/publish

###

### 10. Delete Project (requires login)
# Replace {project_id} with actual project ID
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/v1/projects/{project_id}

###

### Testing with Authorization Header (Alternative to cookies)
### If you prefer to use Authorization header instead of cookies:

### Login and copy the token from response, then use it like this:
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/projects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "name": "Test Project with Bearer Token",
  "description": "Testing with Authorization header"
}

###

### Error Testing Examples

### 11. Test Invalid Login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "wrong@example.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

###

### 12. Test Duplicate Registration
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

###

### 13. Test Unauthorized Access (without login)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/projects

###


### TEMPLATE ENDPOINTS

### 14. Get All Templates (Public)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/templates

###

### 15. Get Templates by Category
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/templates?category=landing-page

###

### 16. Get Single Template
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/templates/TEMPLATE_ID_HERE

###

### 17. Use Template to Create Project (requires login)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/templates/TEMPLATE_ID_HERE/use
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectName": "My New Project from Template"
}

###

### 18. Create New Template (requires login)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/templates
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Custom Template",
  "description": "My custom template",
  "category": "landing-page",
  "components": [
    {
      "id": "custom-1",
      "type": "text",
      "properties": {
        "content": "Custom Content"
      },
      "styles": {
        "color": "blue"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    }
  ],
  "settings": {
    "theme": "light",
    "layout": "responsive"
  }
}

###
